+Optional Termux-X11 AHardwareBuffer path
+--------------------------------------
+A glibc-compatible AHB bridge is required. Read AHB.md for its API contract.
+Set RADV_AHB_LIBRARY to its shared library and RADV_TERMUX_X11_AHB=1 to opt in.
+Without a compatible bridge the ordinary Linux presentation paths remain active.
+Legacy servers retain a render-completion wait; the AHB handle carries no fence.
